trong, but hot temper is concerning for stress resilience.\n\nMaybe we should start by recommending Candidate B, but note concerns and ask others for more info on interpersonal behavior. Or we could recommend Candidate C for situational awareness.\n\nGiven we need to start discussion, we can propose a provisional vote for Candidate B, citing strengths and acknowledging concerns, and ask others for more info on interpersonal behavior.\n\nWe must include METADATA_JSON with vote.\n\nLet's craft message: \"I think Candidate B is currently the strongest overall because of reliability, stress handling, weather assessment, but I am concerned about his nasty remarks; I'd like to hear if anyone has more context on his crew cooperation.\" That connects to discussion.\n\nProceed."}
